wox|n|That part of vessels, instruments, etc., which is held in the hand when used or moved, as the haft of a sword, the knob of a door, the bail of a kettle, etc. ; That of which use is made; the instrument for effecting a purpose; a tool.	n:20g0,10,1~20g0,10,1
wox|v|To touch; to feel with the hand; to use or hold with the hand. ; To manage in using, as a spade or a musket; to wield; often, to manage skillfully. ; To accustom to the hand; to work upon, or take care of, with the hands. ; To receive and transfer; to have pass through one's hands; hence, to buy and sell; as, a merchant handles a variety of goods, or a large stock. ; To deal with; to make a business of. ; To treat; to use, well or ill. ; To manage; to control; to practice skill upon. ; To use or manage in writing or speaking; to treat, as a theme, an argument, or an objection. ; To use the hands.	o:pa5,50,2;fv9,49,3;gd,41,3;gr2,37,3;eqc,34,3;247g,32,4;1yba,31,3;1j90,17,4;pu1,12,5;20zm,6,1~pu1,12,5;247g,32,4;1j90,17,4;gr2,37,3;eqc,34,3;1yba,31,3;gd,41,3;fv9,49,3;pa5,50,2;e4r,5,1	s:20v8,39,3;20g0,20,2;25l5,8,7;n1w,6,3;agz,6,5;qul,2,4~25l5,8,7;agz,6,5;qul,2,4;n1w,6,3;20v8,39,3;20g0,20,2	d:1rlq,51,5;1lun,43,3;n3p,32,5;1cwq,23,4;mtw,17,7;ugr,7,4~mtw,17,7;n3p,32,5;1rlq,51,5;ugr,7,4;1cwq,23,4;1lun,43,3	D:1uqc,22,1~1uqc,22,1
wox|a|To touch; to feel with the hand; to use or hold with the hand. ; To manage in using, as a spade or a musket; to wield; often, to manage skillfully. ; To accustom to the hand; to work upon, or take care of, with the hands. ; To receive and transfer; to have pass through one's hands; hence, to buy and sell; as, a merchant handles a variety of goods, or a large stock. ; To deal with; to make a business of. ; To treat; to use, well or ill. ; To manage; to control; to practice skill upon. ; To use or manage in writing or speaking; to treat, as a theme, an argument, or an objection. ; To use the hands.	j:gd,25,1;1yba,15,1;247g,12,1;20zm,6,1;e4r,5,1~20zm,6,1;gd,25,1;1yba,15,1;247g,12,1;e4r,5,1
